<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style=""><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif" style="" size="4"><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Dear&nbsp;</font><font style="">{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">,</span></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif" size="4"><br></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif" size="4">I'm writing to kindly remind you to review and adjust your email subscription preferences for the Eurasia Group content you wish to receive.&nbsp;</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif" size="4">{!Contact.Preferences_Management_URL_w_Email_check__c}<font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp;or use the “click here” link that can be found at the bottom of all our research emails.<br><br>You may also navigate through&nbsp;Eurasia Group’s client portal at&nbsp;<a title="https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3a%2f%2fgo.eurasiagroup.net%2fe%2f412852%2f2023-04-10%2f23ltzpn%2f2302933673%3fh%3djwpqtppsxnygyei6zk1zwn6o8kzdjqnijs7u2-hcjbc&amp;data=05%7c01%7calbuquerque%40eurasiagroup.net%7ca30f60667dde47ca402708db50ce1f9b%7cc5698eff16b0459492c4790461230a8b%7c0%7c0%7c638192618472605708%7cunknown%7ctwfpbgzsb3d8eyjwijoimc4wljawmdailcjqijoiv2lumziilcjbtii6ik1hawwilcjxvci6mn0%3d%7c3000%7c%7c%7c&amp;sdata=hcym%2f6cmirf69ikdtkl8w1gwvdljhockne7d4xraxi8%3d&amp;reserved=0" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgo.eurasiagroup.net%2Fe%2F412852%2F2023-04-10%2F23ltzpn%2F2302933673%3Fh%3DJWPqTPPsxnYgYei6zk1ZWN6o8KZdJqNIjs7u2-HcjBc&amp;data=05%7C01%7Calbuquerque%40eurasiagroup.net%7Ca30f60667dde47ca402708db50ce1f9b%7Cc5698eff16b0459492c4790461230a8b%7C0%7C0%7C638192618472605708%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=hcym%2F6cmIrF69IKdtkL8W1GWVDLJHocKNe7D4XrAXi8%3D&amp;reserved=0" aria-label="Link library.eurasiagroup.net">library.eurasiagroup.net</a>&nbsp;and log in with your credentials, by following the steps below:</font></font></p><ol style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><li><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif" size="4">Go to the “User” icon&nbsp;on the top&nbsp;right corner of the portal and select “Preferences.”</font></li><li><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif" size="4">Expand the sections to have a detailed view of the&nbsp;publications. Check or uncheck the boxes next to the titles, and then click on the “Save” icon at the bottom of the page.</font></li><li><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif" size="4">Do not forget to&nbsp;update&nbsp;your contact information (First/Last Name, City, Title, and Phone) by editing the "My Profile"&nbsp;section.</font></li></ol><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif" size="4"><br>Please do not hesitate to contact us&nbsp;if you have any queries.</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif" size="4"><br></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif" size="4"><br></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif" style="" size="4">Best Regards,<br>EG Sales Operations</font></p>]]></td>
</tr>
